00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Want to practice your strategy like it's live?
On any chart, click TestingView.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
This is where training becomes measurable.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Create a new session, give it a name that you'll recognize later

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Choose your start date and time,
the exact moment you want to begin.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Set your starting balance and currency,
so every trade is tracked for real.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Let's Start.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000
And just like that, your session is live.
Balance is on-screen, candles are in-sync.

8
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Drive the chart forward, execute your rules,
and build proof with every session.
